local HGd=EGd and(bb.buffCount[EGd]or 0)<2
if BGd==DLe[5119]and hGd>=1000 and(HGd or jGd)then
if HGd then
CGd,DGd=EGd,DLe[5120]
else
CGd,DGd=jGd,DLe[5121]
end
elseif BGd==DLe[5042]and sGd and sGd.ready then
if hGd>=1000 then
